  "id": "005",
  "title": "Diary",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2015-11-13",
  "synopsis": "Do you write a diary? Writing a diary in a language you’re studying can be an effective way of learning. Here’s an example of how you can write a simple summary of your day.",
